 "$comment": "The one event-tag list (GAME_DESIGN 6.5; Lead call 9; BUILD_PLAN 2.7, S4): the names tag rules make from a packed set, and every card, rule and table reads. Exactly 6.5's core tags, the five the Larry moments read (2.6), and the load and fit numbers its table names. Each with its type: a boolean, a number (a unit where 6.5 gives one; first_aid is 0 to 2), or an enum of its values (shelter adds hammock, which the catalog's hammock_system needs; 6.5 lists tent, tarp, bivy and none). Item tags (the catalog's glossary, with bombproof and style) stay item tags; mapping them to these is S8's content/gear/tag_rules.json.",
